Package: agriinsight
Type: Package
Title: Unified Statistical Modeling and Biometrics for Agricultural and Biological Sciences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Paul", "Lopez", email = "paul.lopez@uc.cl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("DeepMind", "Antigravity", role = c("ctb"))
  )
Description: Provides a unified, model-agnostic S3 meta-interface and biometrical computing framework for agricultural, biological, and environmental sciences. Extends the 'easystats' (insight) philosophy to specialized agronomic domains including greenhouse microclimate modeling, plant-microbe interactions (endophytes, Trichoderma, PGPB, ZOIB root colonization, Bliss/Loewe synergy), abiotic stress kinetics (drought FTSW segmented breakpoints with bootstrap CIs, salinity K+/Na+ ion selectivity and osmotic adjustment, anthesis heat shock and non-linear grain filling kinetics), spatial field trials (P-splines, Matheron directional semivariograms), multi-environment stability (AMMI, GGE, ASV, YSI, Wricke ecovalence, Shukla variance, Finlay-Wilkinson regression), 2-stage MET inverse-variance weighting, crop nutrition plateau models (Linear-Plateau, Quadratic-Plateau, Mitscherlich-Bray, EOFR/AOFR), photosynthetic FvCB A/Ci curve fitting, dose-response bioassays (drc ED50 and relative potency), and Compact Letter Displays (Piepho 2004 maximal clique algorithm). Includes automated AI-assisted diagnostic reporting and publication-ready vector SVG figure exports.
